  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "虛擬儀控",
    "sub_ename": "DESIGN AND APPLICATION OF VIRTUAL INSTRUMENTATION",
    "describe_ch": "虛擬儀控在當前工程領域佔有重要的應用角色，舉凡自動化、生產測試、訊號處理領域皆需要相關技能輔助。在生醫領域，虛擬儀控則包含整合生理訊號量測、生理意義分析以及虛擬儀表設計等相關領域知識。因此，本課程規劃包含：1. 基礎虛擬儀控軟體掌握；2. 生理訊號測量及分析； 3. 生理參數代表之生理意義；4. 虛擬儀表之規劃設計及實作； 4. 應用軟體之規劃設計及實作。",
    "describe_eh": "Virtual instrumentation plays an important role in today's engineering applications, requiring skills in automation, production testing and signal processing. In the field of biomedical sciences, virtual instrumentation involves the integration of physiological signal measurement, physiological significance analysis and virtual instrumentation design. Therefore, this course plan includes: 1. basic virtual instrumentation software mastery; 2. physiological signal measurement and analysis; 3. physiological significance of physiological parameter representation; 4. virtual instrumentation planning and implementation; 5. application software planning and implementation.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
